Package: gl-e5800-dashboard
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: robavionix
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-numpy, libtiff6, zoneinfo-europe, zoneinfo-asia, zoneinfo-america, zoneinfo-australia-nz, zoneinfo-pacific
Source: https://github.com/robavionix/gl-e5800-dashboard
Description: Custom touch dashboard for the GL-E5800's built-in screen.
 Replaces the stock gl_screen UI with a fully interactive touch dashboard
 (clock, active SIM, weather, bandwidth/device monitor, currency, OpenClash).
 Keeps the stock UI installed and switchable back at any time via
 /root/dashboard/toggle.sh.
